{comment Verse 1 (single strums with hold / solo voice /snap fingers on 2 and 4)}
[D][*/]   ' Once bitten and twice shy
[Bm][*/]  ' I keep my distance, but you still catch my eye
[Em][*/]  ' Tell me, baby, ' do you recognize me?
[A][*/]   ' Well, it's been a year, ' it doesn't surprise me

{comment Verse 2 (Island strum /solo voice)}
[D] ' "Merry Christmas," ' I wrapped it up and sent it
[Bm] With a note saying "I love you, I meant it"
[Em] Now I know ' what a fool I've been
But if you [A] kissed me now I know you'd fool me again

{comment Chorus (All)}
[D] Last Christmas, I gave you my heart
But the [Bm] very next day you gave it away      (gave it away)
[Em] This year, to save me from tears,
I'll [A] give it to someone special                          (special)

