{comment Verse 3 (single strums with hold / solo voice /snap fingers on 2 and 4)}
[D][*/]   ' A crowded room, ' friends with tired eyes,
[Bm][*/]  ' I'm hiding from you ' and your soul of ice
[Em][*/]  ' I thought you were someone to rely on
[A][*/]   Me? ' I guess I was a shoulder to cry on

{comment Verse 4 (Island strum /solo voice)}
A [D] face on a lover with a fire in his heart
A [Bm] man under cover, but you tore   me    a-
-[Em]part, ooo, ooo,
Now I've [A] found a real love. You'll never fool me again

